🌍 WORLD LOGIC (LOCKED)
This is not open space — it is an active transit megastructure
The “city” is a vertical logistics artery, not a skyline
Architecture exists to move mass, not to be seen
Airspace is narrow, shared, hostile by design
Fighters do not fly around structures → they fly through them
Corridors, vents, docks, spillways, and gaps are intentional flight paths
Missiles, debris, and wreckage use the same routes as ships
Explosions are routine system failures, not cinematic events
Fires burn where fuel and airflow allow — then starve and die
Bombs vanish into infrastructure and detonate out of sight

There is no “front line”
Threats emerge from architecture, not enemies
Destruction feels operational, not dramatic
The structure does not react emotionally
It continues functioning while being destroyed
Survival depends on speed and familiarity, not bravery
Hesitation is fatal
Precision is impossible

This is not a battlefield.
This is infrastructure under stress.

